  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c004",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Found:** the CPU file has one row per VM per 5 minutes (\"min_cpu\", \"max_cpu\", \"avg_cpu\"). The metadata file has one row per VM.\n",
    "**Decision:** two targets per timestamp: the number of VMs (\"active_vm_count\") and the average CPU over VMs (\"aggregate_cpu_utilization\")."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c005",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Is the data clean?\n",
    "**Question:** Any missing values, duplicates, or gaps in time?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "c006",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
